@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: opens the menu of a track and chooses "Add to a playlist"
System -> Spotify: requests the user's playlists
Spotify --> System: returns the playlists
alt there are playlists the user can edit (own or collaborative)
  System --> User: shows the list of playlists
  User -> System: chooses a playlist
  System -> Spotify: adds the track to the playlist
  alt accepted
    Spotify --> System: confirms
    System --> User: informs success
  else rejected (e.g. missing permission)
    Spotify --> System: returns an error
    System --> User: informs the error
  end
else none
  System --> User: informs that there are no playlists to add to
end
@enduml
